#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "The non-equipment datasets are:"
msgstr "非儀器資料集如下："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "All data in this dataset will be captured immediately in digital form."
msgstr "此資料集的所有資料都會直接以數位形式記錄。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "Data in this dataset will first be captured on paper."
msgstr "此資料集的資料最初會以紙本形式記錄。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "A specialized team will perform the data entry."
msgstr "資料輸入將由專業團隊負責。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "A member of the project team will perform the data entry."
msgstr "資料輸入將由一位計畫團隊成員負責。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "Other arrangements have been made for data entry."
msgstr "資料輸入已有其他安排。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "We have arranged for someone to make this dataset available in digital form."
msgstr "本計畫已安排人員將此資料集以數位形式提供。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "We have not yet arranged for someone to make this dataset available in digital form."
msgstr "本計畫尚未安排人員將此資料集以數位形式提供。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "(no name given)"
msgstr "（名稱尚未提供）"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "Other data-entry arrangements:"
msgstr "資料輸入的其他安排："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/02-what-data.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/02-what-data"
msgid "The project includes data capture that does not use measurement equipment."
msgstr "本計畫包含不透過儀器設備進行的資料擷取。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "3. What metadata and documentation (for example the methodology of data collection and way of organising data) will accompany the data?"
msgstr "3. 將提供哪些後設資料與說明文件（例如資料蒐集方法與組織方式）？"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "DDI (Data Documentation Initiative)"
msgstr "DDI（Data Documentation Initiative）"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will include keywords or relevant ontology references to optimize the possibility for discovery and potential reuse."
msgstr "我們將納入關鍵字或相關本體參照，以提高資料被找到及再次使用的可能性。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "The provenance will be captured using W3C PROV."
msgstr "資料溯源將以 W3C PROV 記錄。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will create a data/variable dictionary."
msgstr "本計畫將建立資料字典或變項定義表。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will not create a data/variable dictionary."
msgstr "本計畫不會建立資料字典或變項定義表。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "The selected data-dictionary option cannot be represented by this template; please review it."
msgstr "本模板無法呈現所選的資料字典選項，請核對。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Information not provided: whether a data/variable dictionary will be created."
msgstr "尚待補充：是否將建立資料字典或變項定義表。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Metadata will not be available openly."
msgstr "後設資料不會公開提供。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Information not provided: why the metadata will not be openly available."
msgstr "尚待補充：後設資料不公開提供的原因。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Metadata will be openly available, including instructions on how to access the data."
msgstr "後設資料將公開提供，並包含資料取用說明。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Metadata will be openly available without instructions on how to access the data."
msgstr "後設資料將公開提供，但不包含資料取用說明。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Metadata will be openly available."
msgstr "後設資料將公開提供。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "It will not be provided in a form that can be harvested and indexed."
msgstr "後設資料將不以可供擷取並建立索引的形式提供。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "The selected repository or repositories will provide it in a form that can be harvested and indexed."
msgstr "所選資料儲存庫將以可供擷取並建立索引的形式提供後設資料。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "It will also be provided in a form that can be harvested and indexed."
msgstr "後設資料亦將以可供擷取並建立索引的形式提供。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
#, python-format
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Information not provided: %(metadataInstructionsGap)s; %(metadataHarvestGap)s."
msgstr "尚待補充：%(metadataInstructionsGap)s；%(metadataHarvestGap)s。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "The selected metadata access-instructions option cannot be represented by this template; please review it."
msgstr "本模板無法呈現所選的後設資料取用說明選項，請核對。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Information not provided: whether the metadata will include instructions for accessing the data."
msgstr "尚待補充：後設資料是否會包含取用資料的說明。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "The selected metadata harvesting and indexing option cannot be represented by this template; please review it."
msgstr "本模板無法呈現所選的後設資料擷取與索引選項，請核對。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Information not provided: whether the metadata will be available in a form that can be harvested and indexed."
msgstr "尚待補充：後設資料是否可供自動擷取並建立索引。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "The project will require so little storage space for all data and software (including temporary storage) that it is not a problem."
msgstr "本專案所有資料與軟體（包含暫存空間）所需的儲存空間很少，因此不會造成問題。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
#, python-format
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We estimate the storage space that the project will require for all data and software (including temporary storage) to be %(size)s gigabytes."
msgstr "預估計畫所有資料與軟體（含暫存空間）所需的儲存容量為 %(size)s GB。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Information not provided: the estimated storage space for all project data and software, including temporary storage (GB)."
msgstr "尚待補充：計畫所有資料與軟體（含暫存空間）所需的預估儲存容量（GB）。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will not use a filesystem with files and folders."
msgstr "我們不會使用以檔案與資料夾組成的檔案系統。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will use a filesystem with files and folders with the following folder conventions:"
msgstr "我們將使用以檔案與資料夾組成的檔案系統，並採用以下資料夾規則："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "<p style=\"margin:0\">There will be a <strong>folder for each sample/subject</strong>.</p>"
msgstr "<p style=\"margin:0\">每個樣本／研究對象都會有一個資料夾。</p>"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "<p>Each of those will use the following conventions:</p>"
msgstr "<p>各資料夾將採用以下規則：</p>"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "<p style=\"margin:0\">There will be  a <strong>(sub)folder for each (repeated) analysis</strong>. </p>"
msgstr "<p style=\"margin:0\">每次分析（包括重新分析）都會使用一個子資料夾。</p>"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "<p style=\"margin:0\">There will be a <strong>(sub)folder for each step in the analysis workflow</strong>.</p>"
msgstr "<p style=\"margin:0\">分析工作流程的每個步驟都會使用一個子資料夾。</p>"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will use a filesystem with files and folders."
msgstr "我們將使用以檔案與資料夾組成的檔案系統。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We document how we manage file versioning for files and folders."
msgstr "我們會記錄如何管理檔案與資料夾的版本。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We have not documented how we manage file versioning for files and folders."
msgstr "我們尚未記錄檔案與資料夾的版本管理方式。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "File naming conventions:"
msgstr "檔案命名規則："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will not be storing data in an \"object/document store\" system."
msgstr "我們不會將資料儲存在「物件／文件儲存」系統中。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will be storing data in an \"object/document store\" system."
msgstr "我們將把資料儲存在「物件／文件儲存」系統中。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Object naming conventions:"
msgstr "物件命名規則："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will not use a database system to store project data."
msgstr "我們不會使用資料庫系統儲存專案資料。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will use a database system to store project data."
msgstr "我們將使用資料庫系統儲存專案資料。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Data in the database will be read-only."
msgstr "資料庫中的資料將為唯讀。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "We will be allowing Create, Update and Delete operations for data in the database."
msgstr "我們將允許對資料庫中的資料進行建立、更新與刪除操作。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Modifications will be made by <em>Expiring</em> the existing data and <em>Adding</em> updated data."
msgstr "修改將透過使既有資料失效並新增更新後資料的方式進行。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "Data storage and file conventions"
msgstr "資料儲存與檔案規則"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/03-docs-metadata.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/03-docs-metadata"
msgid "This document does not yet contain an answer about metadata and documentation."
msgstr "本文件尚未說明將提供哪些後設資料與說明文件。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/04-quality-control.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/04-quality-control"
msgid "4. What data quality control measures will be used?"
msgstr "4. 將使用哪些資料品質管控措施？"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/04-quality-control.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/04-quality-control"
msgid "This document does not yet describe data quality checks. Re-used data also need appropriate quality control."
msgstr "本文件尚未說明資料品質檢查方式。使用既有資料時，也需進行適當的品質管控。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "5. How will data and metadata be stored and backed up during the research process?"
msgstr "5. 研究期間將如何儲存與備份資料及後設資料？"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "The project will not use a shared workspace to work with data."
msgstr "專案期間不會使用共享工作空間處理資料。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Data stored by individual project members are backed up reliably and remain traceable, protecting them against loss caused by equipment failure or human error."
msgstr "專案成員自行儲存的資料會妥善備份且可追蹤，避免因設備故障或人為錯誤而遺失。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Data stored by individual project members are not yet adequately backed up and traceable."
msgstr "計畫成員個別存放的資料尚未妥善備份，或尚無法追溯。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "<p class=\"data-gap\" data-requirement-id=\"SE-3a\" data-fact-id=\"backup-reliability\" data-status=\"missing\"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> whether data stored by individual project members are adequately backed up and traceable.</p>"
msgstr "<p class=\"data-gap\" data-requirement-id=\"SE-3a\" data-fact-id=\"backup-reliability\" data-status=\"missing\">尚待補充：計畫成員個別存放的資料是否已妥善備份，並可追溯。</p>"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "There is a shared workspace used during the project for working with data."
msgstr "研究期間將使用共享工作空間處理資料。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Dedicated specialists will operate the shared workspace."
msgstr "共享工作空間將由專責人員維運。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "The shared workspace will not be operated by dedicated specialists."
msgstr "共享工作空間將不由專責人員維運。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Storage needs will be the same during the whole project."
msgstr "所需儲存容量在計畫期間將維持不變。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Storage needs are large at the beginning and will be reduced later."
msgstr "專案初期的儲存需求較大，之後會降低。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Storage needs are small at the beginning and will grow later."
msgstr "專案初期的儲存需求較小，之後會增加。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Storage needs are largest in the middle of the project."
msgstr "專案中期的儲存需求最大。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "The workspace provides sufficient safeguards against a total loss of data."
msgstr "此工作空間具備足以防止資料全部遺失的防護措施。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "All essential data will also be stored elsewhere to prevent a total loss of data."
msgstr "為避免資料全部遺失，重要資料也將另存於其他位置。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Project participants are responsible for backing up project data stored outside the workspace."
msgstr "計畫參與人員負責備份存放於工作空間以外的計畫資料。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Data are stored only in the workspace, so no additional copies of files outside the workspace need to be backed up."
msgstr "資料僅存放於工作空間，因此沒有工作空間以外的檔案副本需要備份。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "All project data stored outside the workspace will be adequately backed up."
msgstr "所有存放於工作空間以外的計畫資料都將妥善備份。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "We will make automated backups of all data stored outside the workspace."
msgstr "存放於共享工作空間以外的資料，將全部自動備份。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "<p class=\"data-gap\" data-requirement-id=\"SE-3a\" data-fact-id=\"working-storage-arrangement\" data-status=\"missing\"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> whether data will be kept in a shared workspace or by individual project members.</p>"
msgstr "<p class=\"data-gap\" data-requirement-id=\"SE-3a\" data-fact-id=\"working-storage-arrangement\" data-status=\"missing\">尚待補充：資料將存放於共享工作空間，或由計畫成員個別存放。</p>"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "<p class=\"data-gap\" data-requirement-id=\"SE-3a\" data-fact-id=\"backup-arrangement\" data-status=\"missing\"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> how project data and metadata will be backed up.</p>"
msgstr "<p class=\"data-gap\" data-requirement-id=\"SE-3a\" data-fact-id=\"backup-arrangement\" data-status=\"missing\">尚待補充：計畫資料與後設資料的備份方式。</p>"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Archival during the project"
msgstr "研究期間的資料封存"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "Data will be archived in cold storage during the project."
msgstr "研究期間將以冷儲存方式封存資料。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "The archive will be stored on disk."
msgstr "封存資料將儲存於磁碟。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/05-store-backup.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/05-store-backup"
msgid "The archive will be stored on tape."
msgstr "封存資料將儲存於磁帶。"

