msgid "6. How will data security and protection of sensitive data be taken care of during the research?"
msgstr "6. 研究期間將如何處理資料安全與敏感資料保護？"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/06-access-security.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/06-access-security"
msgid "Project members do not carry data with them (e.g. on laptops, USB sticks, or other external media)."
msgstr "專案成員不隨身攜帶資料（例如存放於筆記型電腦、USB 隨身碟或其他外部儲存媒體）。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/06-access-security.html.j2
