#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "We will not collect any data related to individuals, i.e. \"personal data\"."
msgstr "我們不會蒐集任何與個人相關的資料，即「個人資料」。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "We will collect data related to individuals, i.e. \"personal data\"."
msgstr "我們將蒐集與個人相關的資料，即「個人資料」。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "The stated legal basis for collecting and processing personal data is a task carried out in the public interest."
msgstr "本計畫填報的個人資料蒐集及處理法律依據為執行公共利益任務。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "We ask the data subjects for their consent."
msgstr "我們會向資料當事人取得同意。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "We will obtain consent for this project's specific use of the data."
msgstr "我們會就本專案特定用途取得同意。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "We will obtain consent for this project's use and for subsequent reuse of the data."
msgstr "我們會就本專案使用及資料再次使用取得同意。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "We will obtain consent for this project's use of the data and for anonymization. We will then anonymize the data for subsequent reuse."
msgstr "我們會就本專案使用資料及匿名化取得同意。之後會將資料匿名化，以供再次使用。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "We will obtain consent to anonymize the data. We will anonymize the data before any further processing."
msgstr "我們會就資料匿名化取得同意，並在任何後續處理前先將資料匿名化。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "The data subjects will be informed as follows:"
msgstr "我們將以下列方式告知資料當事人："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "The consent form will not be available to people who reuse the data."
msgstr "同意書不會提供給資料再次使用者。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
