#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Alternative legal basis for collecting personal data:"
msgstr "蒐集個人資料的其他法律依據："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "An alternative legal basis was selected."
msgstr "本計畫已選擇其他法律依據。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "An alternative legal basis was selected, but it has not been specified; see Question 7."
msgstr "本計畫選擇了其他法律依據，但尚未說明具體依據；請參閱第 7 題。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "performance of a contract."
msgstr "履行契約。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "legitimate interests."
msgstr "正當利益。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "protection of vital interests."
msgstr "保護重大利益。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "compliance with a legal obligation."
msgstr "履行法定義務。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "The purpose of processing the personal data can be described as follows:"
msgstr "處理個人資料的目的可描述如下："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "According to the questionnaire, a data protection impact assessment (DPIA) is required."
msgstr "依問卷填答，本計畫需要進行資料保護影響評估（DPIA）。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Data protection impact assessments (DPIAs) have been performed for the personal data."
msgstr "本計畫已針對個人資料進行資料保護影響評估（DPIA）。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Data concerning vulnerable data subjects, including minors, employees, elderly people, mentally incapacitated people, and patients receiving care."
msgstr "涉及弱勢資料當事人的資料，包括未成年人、受僱者、高齡者、心智能力受限者，以及接受照護的病患。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Sensitive data or data of a highly personal nature, including racial or ethnic origin, political opinions, religious or philosophical beliefs, trade union membership, genetic data, health data, biometric data, or sexual orientation."
msgstr "敏感資料或高度私密的個人資料，包括種族或族裔、政治觀點、宗教或哲學信仰、工會會員身分、基因資料、健康資料、生物辨識資料，或性傾向。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Data processed on a large scale, considering the proportion of the relevant population, duration of processing, geographical scale, and volume or range of data."
msgstr "大規模處理的資料（考量相關人口比例、處理期間、地理範圍，以及資料量或範圍）。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Automated decision-making with legal or similarly significant effects on data subjects."
msgstr "對資料當事人產生法律效力或類似重大影響的自動化決策。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Evaluation or scoring concerning work performance, economic situation, health, personal preferences or interests, reliability or behaviour, location, or movements."
msgstr "針對工作表現、經濟狀況、健康、個人偏好或興趣、可靠性或行為、位置或移動情形進行評估或評分。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Systematic monitoring used to observe, monitor, or control data subjects, including data collected through networks."
msgstr "用於觀察、監測或控制資料當事人的系統性監測，包括透過網路蒐集的資料。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Matching or combining datasets, for example from processing operations performed for different purposes."
msgstr "比對或合併資料集，例如來自原先為不同目的進行的資料處理作業。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Innovative use or application of new technological or organizational solutions, such as combining fingerprint and face recognition for physical access control."
msgstr "創新地使用或應用新的技術或組織解決方案，例如結合指紋與臉部辨識進行實體門禁管制。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Processing that prevents data subjects from exercising a right or using a service or a contract."
msgstr "使資料當事人無法行使權利、使用服務或利用契約的資料處理。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Data protection impact assessments and the data they cover:"
msgstr "資料保護影響評估及其涵蓋的資料："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "<p>DPIA:</p>"
msgstr "<p>DPIA：</p>"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "The following indicators were selected as reasons why a DPIA is deemed necessary:"
msgstr "本計畫選擇以下指標，作為需要進行資料保護影響評估（DPIA）的原因："

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "Data protection impact assessments (DPIAs) have not been performed for the personal data."
msgstr "本計畫未針對個人資料進行資料保護影響評估（DPIA）。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
msgctxt "questions/09-ethical-issues"
msgid "According to the questionnaire, a data protection impact assessment (DPIA) is not required."
msgstr "依問卷填答，本計畫不需要進行資料保護影響評估（DPIA）。"

#. Approved existing Chinese; no retranslation.
#: src/questions/09-ethical-issues.html.j2
